Article 3 (Days on Which the Library Is Closed)
(1) The Library shall be closed on the following days:
1. Public holidays of government offices, excluding Sundays: Provided, That it shall be closed on Sundays falling during the Lunar New Year or Chuseok holiday periods;
2. The second and fourth Mondays of each month;
3. Days on which the Director deems it necessary to close the Library for organizing books or other reasons.
(2) The Director shall give prior notice of any closure under paragraph (1) 3.
